  Local manifest for android-arm-buildtools.

  Dropped into .repo/local_manifests/ after `repo init` against the
  upstream platform manifest. We do not redefine the project list here
  (that would be brittle across AOSP branches); instead we let upstream
  decide what gets fetched and use repo's partial-clone + shallow-clone
  flags at sync time to keep the working tree small.

  This file is intentionally minimal. If you find a specific project
  is required but missing for your AOSP branch, add a <project> tag
  here pointing at the upstream remote.

  Reference: https://gerrit.googlesource.com/git-repo/+/HEAD/docs/manifest-format.md
-->
